100   ; n iterations on circular list of length n
100   ; n iterations on a DAG of size n^2 but only (approx) n objects
9     ; n iterations on a very large tree (worse than exponential in n)
2000  ; n iterations on flat vectors of length n
5000  ; n iterations on lists of length n, with small trees as elements
10000 ; n iterations on lists of depth n
#t


